const metrics=[{label:"今日新增",value:"18",delta:"+6 vs 昨日"},{label:"高匹配",value:"7",delta:"S/A 级"},{label:"待审批",value:"5",delta:"需要你确认"},{label:"已投递",value:"12",delta:"本周累计"}];
let selected=jobs[0],segment="全部",currentView="dashboard";
const view=document.getElementById('view'),toast=document.getElementById('toast');
function showToast(message){toast.textContent=message;toast.classList.add('show');setTimeout(()=>toast.classList.remove('show'),1700)}
function dashboard(){const filters=["全部","远程优先","南通崇川","南京建邺/浦口","上海/苏州/杭州"];const filtered=segment==="全部"?jobs:jobs.filter(j=>j.segment===segment);view.innerHTML=`<div class="dashboard-grid"><section class="overview-column"><div class="metric-grid">${metrics.map(m=>`<article class="metric"><span>${m.label}</span><strong>${m.value}</strong><small>${m.delta}</small></article>`).join('')}</div><button class="engineering-callout" id="engineeringCallout"><div class="engineering-callout-icon">◉</div><div><strong>工程证据已启用</strong><span>模型健康检查 · 生成指标 · AI Coding 交付账本</span></div><span>↗</span></button><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Priority Queue</span><h2>今日优先岗位</h2></div><button class="ghost-button" id="allBtn">查看全部 ↗</button></div><div class="segment-tabs">${filters.map(f=>`<button data-segment="${f}" class="${segment===f?'active':''}">${f}</button>`).join('')}</div><div class="job-list">${filtered.map(j=>`<button class="job-row ${selected.id===j.id?'selected':''}" data-id="${j.id}"><div class="grade grade-${j.grade.toLowerCase()}">${j.grade}</div><div class="job-main"><div class="job-title-line"><strong>${j.title}</strong><span>${j.status}</span></div><div class="job-meta"><span>${j.company}</span><span>⌖ ${j.location}</span><span>${j.salary}</span></div><div class="skill-line">${j.skills.slice(0,4).map(s=>`<span>${s}</span>`).join('')}</div></div><div class="score"><strong>${j.score}</strong><span>匹配分</span></div><span>›</span></button>`).join('')}</div></section><aside class="detail-panel"><div class="detail-head"><div class="grade grade-${selected.grade.toLowerCase()}">${selected.grade}</div><div><span class="eyebrow">${selected.segment}</span><h3>${selected.title}</h3><p>${selected.company} · ${selected.tier}</p></div></div><div class="score-orbit"><div><strong>${selected.score}</strong><span>综合匹配</span></div><div class="orbit-copy"><span>✓ 技术栈命中</span><span>✓ 地区优先级命中</span><span>◷ 等待 HR 核验</span></div></div><div class="detail-section"><h4>岗位实际工作</h4><p>${selected.summary}</p></div><div class="detail-section"><h4>匹配证据</h4><ul><li>Camera Market：FastAPI、PostgreSQL、Docker</li><li>LangGraph/RAG：状态工作流、中文检索、来源引用</li><li>PhotoAtelier：产品流程、交互设计与测试</li></ul></div><div class="risk-box"><span>◇</span><div><strong>面试风险</strong><p>${selected.risk}</p></div></div><div class="resume-box"><span>推荐简历</span><strong>${selected.resume}</strong><small>放大：${selected.skills.slice(0,3).join(' · ')}</small></div><div class="package-text">您好，我是 2028 届人工智能本科生，看到贵司的“${selected.title}”实习岗位。我具备 ${selected.skills.slice(0,4).join('、')} 的项目实践，可稳定实习每周至少 3 天、持续至少 3 个月。</div><div class="approval-actions"><button class="ghost-button" id="pauseBtn">暂不投递</button><button class="primary-button" id="packageBtn">✦ 生成投递包</button></div></aside></div>`;bindDashboard()}
function bindDashboard(){document.querySelectorAll('[data-segment]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{segment=b.dataset.segment;dashboard()});document.querySelectorAll('.job-row').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{selected=jobs.find(j=>j.id===Number(b.dataset.id));dashboard()});document.getElementById('packageBtn').onclick=()=>{selected.status='已准备';showToast('已生成审批优先的投递包，尚未外部提交');dashboard()};document.getElementById('pauseBtn').onclick=()=>showToast('已暂停，不会自动投递');document.getElementById('allBtn').onclick=()=>renderTable('岗位发现','聚合、去重、核验并按固定顺序排序。');document.getElementById('engineeringCallout').onclick=()=>renderEngineering()}

function renderEngineering(){view.innerHTML=`<section class="engineering-page"><header class="engineering-hero"><div><span class="eyebrow">Engineering Evidence</span><h2>把“会用 AI Coding”变成可核验的工程证据</h2><p>记录模型服务状态、交付时间、人工修改、测试结果和验收标准。所有数据都区分真实采集与演示数据。</p></div><div class="runtime-state"><span class="runtime-pulse"></span><div><strong>Model Gateway Healthy</strong><small>mock · qwen2.5:3b</small></div></div></header><div class="engineering-metrics"><article class="engineering-metric"><span>模型服务</span><strong>Healthy</strong><small>Mock 默认 · 可切 Ollama / vLLM</small></article><article class="engineering-metric"><span>接口层</span><strong>3</strong><small>health · generate · metrics</small></article><article class="engineering-metric"><span>测试通过率</span><strong>100%</strong><small>后端工程测试</small></article><article class="engineering-metric"><span>人工修改占比</span><strong>25.7%</strong><small>示例记录，生产由 Git/CI 采集</small></article></div><div class="engineering-grid"><article class="engineering-panel"><div class="panel-title"><div><span class="eyebrow">Model Runtime</span><h3>本地模型服务</h3></div><span>◇</span></div><div class="runtime-diagram"><div>Career Copilot</div><i></i><div>Model Gateway</div><i></i><div>Ollama / vLLM</div></div><dl class="runtime-details"><div><dt>Provider</dt><dd>mock</dd></div><div><dt>Endpoint</dt><dd>local://mock</dd></div><div><dt>Success rate</dt><dd>100%</dd></div><div><dt>Latency</dt><dd>0 ms</dd></div><div><dt>External request</dt><dd>No</dd></div></dl><p class="evidence-note">默认 Mock 模式保证开箱即用且不产生外部请求；配置环境变量后可连接 Ollama 或 OpenAI-compatible vLLM 服务。</p></article><article class="engineering-panel"><div class="panel-title"><div><span class="eyebrow">Quality Gate</span><h3>人工保险栓</h3></div><span>◎</span></div><div class="quality-bars"><div><span>测试通过率</span><strong>100%</strong><i><b style="width:100%"></b></i></div><div><span>验收标准完成率</span><strong>100%</strong><i><b style="width:100%"></b></i></div><div><span>人工修改占比</span><strong>25.7%</strong><i><b style="width:25.7%"></b></i></div></div><ul class="quality-list"><li>✓ AI 生成不等于完成，必须经过测试和验收。</li><li>✓ 简历只引用可追溯项目证据。</li><li>✓ 演示数据与真实采集数据明确区分。</li></ul></article></div><section class="delivery-section"><header><div><span class="eyebrow">Delivery Ledger</span><h3>AI Coding 交付账本</h3></div><button class="primary-button" id="recordDelivery">记录本次交付</button></header><div class="delivery-table-wrap"><table class="data-table delivery-table"><thead><tr><th>项目 / 任务</th><th>工具</th><th>耗时</th><th>文件</th><th>测试</th><th>验收</th><th>人工修改</th><th>状态</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Career Copilot V2</strong><small>模型网关与工程证据模块</small></td><td>ChatGPT coding workflow</td><td>2h 00m</td><td>14</td><td>6 / 6</td><td>6 / 6</td><td>25.7%</td><td><span class="status verified">已验证</span></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Career Copilot V2</strong><small>审批优先投递闭环</small></td><td>Codex review workflow</td><td>1h 20m</td><td>8</td><td>4 / 4</td><td>5 / 5</td><td>31.4%</td><td><span class="status verified">已验证</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="evidence-note">当前页面含演示记录。生产版本将通过 Git diff、CI 测试结果和人工复盘表单采集。</p></section></section>`;document.getElementById('recordDelivery').onclick=()=>showToast('交付记录入口已连接到工程证据 API')}
function renderTable(title,desc){currentView=title;view.innerHTML=`<section class="content-page"><header class="content-page-header"><div><span class="eyebrow">Workspace Module</span><h2>${title}</h2><p style="font-size:10px;color:#8f9baa;margin:6px 0 0">${desc}</p></div><button class="primary-button" id="newRecord">新建记录</button></header><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>公司</th><th>岗位</th><th>位置</th><th>状态</th><th>匹配分</th></tr></thead><tbody>${jobs.map(j=>`<tr><td>${j.company}</td><td>${j.title}</td><td>${j.location}</td><td><span class="status-dot">${j.status}</span></td><td>${j.score}</td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></section>`;document.getElementById('newRecord').onclick=()=>showToast('新建记录入口已连接到产品流程')}
const viewMap={dashboard:()=>dashboard(),jobs:()=>renderTable('岗位发现','聚合、去重、核验并按固定顺序排序。'),applications:()=>renderTable('投递管理','区分待投、已准备、已投递、已读、沟通与面试。'),resumes:()=>renderTable('AI 简历工作室','所有改写都引用 Career Vault 的真实项目证据。'),interviews:()=>renderTable('面试管理','管理面试轮次、问题、复盘和技能缺口。'),analytics:()=>renderTable('数据洞察','分析回复率、面试率、地区、渠道和简历版本表现。'),engineering:()=>renderEngineering()};
document.querySelectorAll('.nav-item').forEach(btn=>btn.onclick=()=>{document.querySelectorAll('.nav-item').forEach(x=>x.classList.remove('active'));btn.classList.add('active');viewMap[btn.dataset.view]()});document.getElementById('runBtn').onclick=()=>showToast('今日搜投流程已启动：采集 → 核验 → 评分 → 审批');document.getElementById('importBtn').onclick=()=>showToast('岗位 JSON 导入入口已就绪');if(location.hash==='#engineering'){renderEngineering();document.querySelectorAll('.nav-item').forEach(x=>x.classList.toggle('active',x.dataset.view==='engineering'))}else{dashboard();}
